        ecrm:P3_has_note               "This box was part of a group of lacquer items which were a gift from the Shogun Tokugawa Iemochi (r.1858-66) to Queen Victoria (r.1837-1901) in 1860, and subsequently donated to the V&A in 1865."@en .

